# {{distribution}}

A [catalog-sync](https://pypi.org/project/catalog-sync/) connector for {{title}}: the
`{{source_name}}` source and the `{{name}}` credential. Generated by
`catalog-sync new-connector {{name}} --auth {{auth}} --pagination {{pagination}}`.

It reads a made-up service. Everything that has to change to read the real one is marked
`TODO(connector)`; the rest already works, and the tests run the connector through pull and
normalize against a synthetic service, so you always know whether a change broke it.

```console
$ uv sync
$ uv run pytest -q                  # green from the start
$ uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check . && uv run mypy --strict src
$ grep -rn "TODO(connector)" .      # what is left to fill in
```

